# A committed write the view's log never carries.
MODULE: QuiescentExactWriteNotLogged
TARGET: QuiescentExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a source write changes the winner without reaching the log the view tails
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
       /\ logs' = [logs EXCEPT ![phys] = Append(@, u)]
--- REPLACE
       /\ logs' = logs
--- END
